---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Authorship" description="The Cespedes Method is co-developed with Edgardo M. Cespedes, MD — a board-certified cardiologist in private practice in Miami.">
  <section class="head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">§ 02 — Authorship</p>
      <h1 class="serif reveal">Co-developed with a practicing specialist.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <aside class="col-mark">
        <div class="portrait reveal">
          <!-- Placeholder portrait. Founder will drop a real photograph at /public/portraits/cespedes.jpg. -->
          <div class="portrait-frame" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="mono portrait-tag">Portrait pending</span>
          </div>
          <p class="caption mono">Edgardo&nbsp;M. Cespedes,&nbsp;MD</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <div class="col-body">
        <h2 class="serif reveal">The clinical author of the Method.</h2>
        <p class="lede reveal">
          Edgardo&nbsp;M. Cespedes,&nbsp;MD is a board-certified cardiologist in private practice in Miami.
          Board-certified in Cardiovascular Disease and Internal Medicine. Over three decades of clinical practice.
          A native of Nicaragua and a long-standing member of the South Florida specialty community.
        </p>
        <p class="reveal">
          Dr. Cespedes is the clinical author of The Cespedes Method. His practice is the reference deployment —
          the live setting against which every clinical decision in the system is reviewed before it ships
          to any other practice. He is the supervising clinician for the bilingual triage protocol,
          the structure of every SOAP template, the criteria for emergency escalation, and the boundary
          between what the system handles autonomously and what is routed to a human.
        </p>
        <h3 class="serif reveal">The working arrangement</h3>
        <p class="reveal">
          ARX builds the system. Dr. Cespedes reviews and approves the clinical contract — the rules
          the system operates by — and signs every clinical document the system produces. Patient safety
          and clinical liability remain with the licensed physician. The Method does not remove the doctor
          from clinical decisions; it removes the doctor from administrative ones.
        </p>
        <h3 class="serif reveal">Why this matters for prospective practices</h3>
        <p class="reveal">
          A specialty practice taking on operating infrastructure built by a vendor with no clinical authorship
          inherits the vendor's judgment about what a SOAP note should contain, when a refill is reasonable,
          and what constitutes an emergency. With ARX, that judgment came from a working cardiologist
          before any line of production code shipped. We are willing to put that detail in writing.
          The private memo covers it. <a href="/memo" class="inline">Request the memo&nbsp;→</a>
        </p>
        <h3 class="serif reveal">Credentials</h3>
        <ul class="credentials reveal">
          <li><span class="mono lbl">Board certification</span><p>Cardiovascular Disease · Internal Medicine</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono lbl">Practice</span><p>Cespedes Cardiology — Miami, Florida · <a class="inline" href="https://edgardocespedesmd.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">edgardocespedesmd.com&nbsp;↗</a></p></li>
          <li><span class="mono lbl">Languages</span><p>English · Spanish (native)</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono lbl">Tenure</span><p>30+ years in private specialty practice in South Florida</p></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .head { padding-top: clamp(80px, 12vw, 120px); padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px); }
  .head h1 { font-size: var(--t-h1); margin-top: 18px; max-width: 18ch; }
  .two-col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
  .col-mark { position: sticky; top: 96px; }
  .col-body > * + * { margin-top: 24px; }
  .col-body h2 { font-size: var(--t-h2); }
  .col-body h3 { font-size: var(--t-h3); margin-top: 40px; }
  .col-body p { font-size: var(--t-lede); line-height: var(--lh-loose); }

  .portrait-frame {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; background: var(--paper-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 2px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .portrait-tag { font-size: var(--t-micro); letter-spacing: var(--track-mono); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .caption { font-size: var(--t-micro); letter-spacing: var(--track-mono); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; }

  .credentials { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .credentials li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .credentials .lbl { font-size: var(--t-micro); letter-spacing: var(--track-mono); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--forest); padding-top: 4px; }
  .credentials p { font-size: var(--t-base); line-height: var(--lh-base); color: var(--ink); }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .col-mark { position: static; max-width: 260px; }
    .credentials li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
